-- Restrict EXECUTE on all custom functions to service_role only.
-- Functions are intended to be called by the Go game server (service_role)
-- or via direct postgres connection. anon/authenticated must not invoke them.
-- Hand-written because supabase db diff (migra) does not detect privilege changes.
-- Exception: public.is_admin() is re-granted because admin RLS policies invoke it
-- as the authenticated role.

revoke execute on function data.list_activity_configs() from public, anon, authenticated;
grant execute on function data.list_activity_configs() to service_role;
